      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "REST vs RPC/gRPC vs GraphQL",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "0aDHt5KkwiFnjgry2JSDT",
      "originalText": "REST vs RPC/gRPC vs GraphQL",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "7Q199MEUUz3KU6AeUKZdD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 267.76825232574026,
      "y": -1751.2544357914362,
      "width": 441.9355773925781,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 74628341,
      "version": 637,
      "versionNonce": 1269281723,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790385842186,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- REST thinks in resources (nouns). \n    You manipulate things.\n    e.g\n- RPC/gRPC thinks in actions (verbs). \n    You call functions.\n    e.g\n- GraphQL thinks in graphs (relationships). \n    You query exactly what you need.\n    e.g",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- REST thinks in resources (nouns). \n    You manipulate things.\n    e.g\n- RPC/gRPC thinks in actions (verbs). \n    You call functions.\n    e.g\n- GraphQL thinks in graphs (relationships). \n    You query exactly what you need.\n    e.g",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4Z25ku80w7syXxhdyFVIP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 281.568240118709,
      "y": -1547.8542893070612,
      "width": 357.3916931152344,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 76912661,
      "version": 446,
      "versionNonce": 1972339803,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790385842186,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "***These aren't just syntactic differences —\n they represent fundamentally different ways \n of modelling our API.***",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "***These aren't just syntactic differences —\n they represent fundamentally different ways \n of modelling our API.***",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
