    {
      "id": "eXLX3Ai9LzduiFXs9VBUN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 282.811155435772,
      "y": -80.49043483004277,
      "width": 664.9130249023438,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ab",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 633115579,
      "version": 729,
      "versionNonce": 612301621,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790330022733,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nMethod     Idempotent?  Safe?       Body?        Use\nGET        ✅ Yes        ✅ Yes       No           Read — never modify state\nPOST      ❌ No         ❌ No        Yes          Create — not idempotent by default\nPUT        ✅ Yes        ❌ No        Yes          Replace entire resource\nPATCH      ❌ No*       ❌ No        Yes          Partial update\nDELETE    ✅ Yes       ❌ No        Optional    Delete",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nMethod     Idempotent?  Safe?       Body?        Use\nGET        ✅ Yes        ✅ Yes       No           Read — never modify state\nPOST      ❌ No         ❌ No        Yes          Create — not idempotent by default\nPUT        ✅ Yes        ❌ No        Yes          Replace entire resource\nPATCH      ❌ No*       ❌ No        Yes          Partial update\nDELETE    ✅ Yes       ❌ No        Optional    Delete",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "NZ7H499MkmK9Y-fwTyPWo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 281.41106998655323,
      "y": 74.44286595120741,
      "width": 629.3274536132812,
      "height": 120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ae",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1354668059,
      "version": 724,
      "versionNonce": 298044565,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790330022733,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "***Safe means the request doesn't modify server state.\nIdempotent means calling it multiple times has the same effect as calling it once.\n\nPUT is idempotent because PUT /users/123 { name: \"John\" } called 10 times \nalways results in the same state. POST is not because \nPOST /orders called 10 times creates 10 orders.***",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "***Safe means the request doesn't modify server state.\nIdempotent means calling it multiple times has the same effect as calling it once.\n\nPUT is idempotent because PUT /users/123 { name: \"John\" } called 10 times \nalways results in the same state. POST is not because \nPOST /orders called 10 times creates 10 orders.***",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "IvXS0MCWefn-Ro47QeBhG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 381.81107914182667,
      "y": -95.52390193209465,
      "width": 434.11981201171875,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
